## Target Identity and Functional Architecture

Caraway Shadow tests the historical seed-spice hypothesis without surrendering La Nuit to food. In TARGET / IDEAL, cardamom remains primary and only 4 µL active Caraway sits underneath, framed by lavender, linalool, Hedione, cedar, Vertofix, and Iso E. CURRENT is the zero-caraway base because the natural lacks current composite authority. Coriander, anise, tobacco, balsams, extra musk, and every tincture are excluded. TARGET / IDEAL remains separate in `../candidates/LN-08.json`.

