## Missing-Chemical Impact and Preparation

TARGET / IDEAL retains a restrained historical caraway shadow. CURRENT deliberately omits Caraway because the owned 10% lot has no defensible composite-natural model; cardamom and linalool preserve only spice-to-lavender continuity. Unavailable Ethyl Linalool is also omitted. Verify EB; evaluate caraway only in a constant-total, carrier-matched arm after stock-basis verification.

## Controlled Blinded Test Plan

Run a balanced-order, equal-mass and equal-concentration three-arm test: current LN-08 as the zero-caraway base, LN-01, and a carrier-matched caraway addition arm replacing 40 µL of the LN-08 base with 40 µL of the verified 10% w/w Caraway stock. Run the addition arm only after composite-natural and stock authority are resolved. Assess caraway detectability, cardamom dominance, savory/culinary drift, La Nuit retention, and liking at 0, 5, and 30 minutes and 2 and 4 hours. No physical result exists.

## Claim Ceiling

Physical liking, sensory similarity, stability, and measured headspace are `NOT TESTED`; safety and release are `NOT CLEARED`.

